{"seq":9,"slug":"lc0300-longest-increasing-subsequence","title":"LeetCode 300 最长递增子序列","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-dp/lc0300-longest-increasing-subsequence","wordCount":862,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-300-最长递增子序列\">LeetCode 300 最长递增子序列</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给你一个整数数组 <code>nums</code>，找到其中最长严格递增子序列的长度。</p>\n<p>子序列是由数组派生而来的序列，删除（或不删除）数组中的元素而不改变其余元素的顺序。例如，<code>[3,6,2,7]</code> 是数组 <code>[0,3,1,6,2,2,7]</code> 的子序列。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>1 ≤ nums.length ≤ 2500</li>\n<li>-10⁴ ≤ nums[i] ≤ 10⁴</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>进阶</strong>：你能将算法的时间复杂度降低到 O(n log n) 吗？</p>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<p>输入：nums = [10,9,2,5,3,7,101,18] 输出：4解释：最长递增子序列为 [2,3,7,101] 或 [2,5,7,101]，长度为 4。</p>\n<p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<p>输入：nums = [0,1,0,3,2,3] 输出：4</p>\n<p><strong>示例 3：</strong></p>\n<p>输入：nums = [7,7,7,7,7,7,7] 输出：1</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>最长递增子序列（LIS）是 DP 的经典问题之一，有 O(n²) 的标准 DP 解法和 O(n log n) 的贪心 + 二分优化解法。</p>\n<p><strong>O(n²) DP 解法</strong>：定义 <code>dp[i]</code> 为以 <code>nums[i]</code> 结尾的最长递增子序列长度。对每个位置 <code>i</code>，遍历所有 <code>j &lt; i</code>，如果 <code>nums[j] &lt; nums[i]</code>，则可以在以 <code>nums[j]</code> 结尾的 LIS 后面接上 <code>nums[i]</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>状态转移方程</strong>：<code>dp[i] = max(dp[j] + 1)</code> 对所有 <code>j &lt; i</code> 且 <code>nums[j] &lt; nums[i]</code></p>\n<p><strong>O(n log n) 贪心 + 二分</strong>：维护一个辅助数组 <code>tails</code>，<code>tails[k]</code> 表示长度为 <code>k+1</code> 的递增子序列的最小末尾元素。遍历 <code>nums</code>，对每个元素用二分查找确定其在 <code>tails</code> 中的位置。</p>\n<p>贪心的核心思想：为了让递增子序列尽可能长，每个长度对应的末尾元素应该尽可能小。这样后续元素有更大的&quot;接入空间&quot;。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>核心思想</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>暴力枚举</td>\n<td>O(2ⁿ)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>枚举所有子序列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DP</td>\n<td>O(n²)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>dp[i] = 以 nums[i] 结尾的 LIS 长度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>贪心 + 二分</td>\n<td>O(n log n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>维护最小末尾数组</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><p><strong>O(n²) DP 解法：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function lengthOfLIS(nums: number[]): number {&#10;  const n = nums.length;&#10;  const dp = new Array(n).fill(1);&#10;  let maxLen = 1;&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 1; i &lt; n; i++) {&#10;    for (let j = 0; j &lt; i; j++) {&#10;      if (nums[j] &lt; nums[i]) {&#10;        dp[i] = Math.max(dp[i], dp[j] + 1);&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;    maxLen = Math.max(maxLen, dp[i]);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return maxLen;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> lengthOfLIS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxLen </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i; j</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nums[j] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[i]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        dp[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(dp[i], dp[j] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    maxLen </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(maxLen, dp[i]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxLen;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>O(n log n) 贪心 + 二分解法：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function lengthOfLISOptimized(nums: number[]): number {&#10;  const tails: number[] = [];&#10;&#10;  for (const num of nums) {&#10;    let left = 0;&#10;    let right = tails.length;&#10;&#10;    while (left &lt; right) {&#10;      const mid = left + Math.floor((right - left) / 2);&#10;      if (tails[mid] &lt; num) {&#10;        left = mid + 1;&#10;      } else {&#10;        right = mid;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    if (left === tails.length) {&#10;      tails.push(num);&#10;    } else {&#10;      tails[left] = num;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return tails.length;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> lengthOfLISOptimized</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tails</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> num</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tails.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> mid</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">floor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (tails[mid] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> num) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mid;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tails.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      tails.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(num);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      tails[left] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> num;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tails.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>O(n²) DP 逻辑详解：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>dp[i]</code> 初始化为 1：每个元素自身构成长度为 1 的 LIS</li>\n<li>对于每个位置 <code>i</code>，检查所有前面的位置 <code>j</code></li>\n<li>如果 <code>nums[j] &lt; nums[i]</code>，说明 <code>nums[i]</code> 可以接在以 <code>nums[j]</code> 结尾的 LIS 后面</li>\n<li>取所有可行的 <code>dp[j] + 1</code> 中的最大值</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>O(n log n) 贪心 + 二分逻辑详解：</strong></p>\n<p><code>tails</code> 数组始终保持严格递增。对于每个 <code>num</code>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>用二分查找找到 <code>tails</code> 中第一个 ≥ <code>num</code> 的位置 <code>left</code></li>\n<li>如果 <code>left === tails.length</code>：<code>num</code> 比所有末尾都大，可以延长 LIS，追加到末尾</li>\n<li>否则：将 <code>tails[left]</code> 替换为 <code>num</code>，因为 <code>num</code> 更小，有利于后续接入更多元素</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>注意</strong>：<code>tails</code> 数组的内容不是真正的 LIS，但其<strong>长度</strong>等于 LIS 的长度。</p>\n<p><strong>模拟执行（nums = [10,9,2,5,3,7,101,18]）：</strong></p>\n<p>贪心 + 二分版本：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>10: tails=[10]</li>\n<li>9: 9&lt;10, tails=[9]</li>\n<li>2: 2&lt;9, tails=[2]</li>\n<li>5: 5&gt;2, tails=[2,5]</li>\n<li>3: 3&gt;2 但 3&lt;5, tails=[2,3]</li>\n<li>7: 7&gt;3, tails=[2,3,7]</li>\n<li>101: 101&gt;7, tails=[2,3,7,101]</li>\n<li>18: 18&lt;101, tails=[2,3,7,18]</li>\n<li>返回 4</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>O(n²) DP</th>\n<th>O(n log n) 贪心+二分</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(n²)</td>\n<td>O(n log n)</td>\n<td>二分优化内层循环</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>dp 数组 / tails 数组</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>LIS 是 DP 中的核心问题模型。O(n²) 解法展示了&quot;以 nums[i] 结尾&quot;的状态定义技巧，O(n log n) 解法展示了&quot;贪心 + 二分维护单调序列&quot;的高级技巧。这两种方法在 LC #354（俄罗斯套娃信封问题，二维 LIS）和 LC #1143（最长公共子序列）等进阶问题中有直接应用。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 300 最长递增子序列","id":"leetcode-300-最长递增子序列"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 213 打家劫舍 II","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-dp/lc0213-house-robber-ii"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 322 零钱兑换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-dp/lc0322-coin-change"}}